    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0002_91cf7aafd7e4.jpeg\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br />Solving we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
